<title>USA: Italy's Fila Holding SpA Q3 net rises.</title>
<headline>Italy's Fila Holding SpA Q3 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>THIRD QUARTER     FIRST NINE MONTHS</p>
<p>			    ended September 30  ended September 30</p>
<p>			    1995	 1996	  1995	 1996</p>
<p>Net Revenues (U.S. $/million)</p>
<p>			    269.3	401.8	 683.7    1,061.8</p>
<p>Net Income (U.S. $/million)</p>
<p>			     22.7	 42.8	  49.5	 96.9</p>
<p>Earnings per ADS(E) (U.S. $ADS)</p>
<p>			     0.91	 1.61	  1.98	 3.65</p>
<p>Number of ADSs outstanding:</p>
<p>		     25,000,000 26,500,000  25,000,000 26,500,000</p>
<p>Average exchange rate</p>
<p>(Lit. per U.S. dollar)</p>
<p>			    1,616	1,521	 1,639	1,550</p>
<p>NOTE: Earnings per ADS were calculated by dividing net income by the number of ADS outstanding during the period (each ADS representing five ordinary shares).</p>
<p>Figures may not add due to rounding.</p>
</text>
